{"sections":[{"slug":"BorceuxVitaleAzumayaCategory","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"BorceuxVitaleAzumayaCategory"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Azumaya categories"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">参考资料</span>. "},"author":{"Plain":"Francis Borceux, Enrico Vitale"},"page-title":{"Plain":"Azumaya categories"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"参考资料"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>We define the notions of Azumaya category and Brauer group in category theory enriched over some very general base category $\\mathcal V$.</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}}}]}